@{ViewData["Title"]="Citizen access";}
<section class="panel form-panel"><span class="eyebrow">CITIZEN ACCESS</span><h1>Track your complaint</h1><p>You do not need an officer account to submit a complaint or track it.</p><a class="button primary" href="/Track">Use my private tracking code</a><a class="button secondary" href="/Submit">Make a new complaint</a><h2>Mobile OTP sign-in</h2><p>Mobile verification is not connected yet. SMS delivery must be configured before phone sign-in becomes available. We are not collecting phone numbers on this page.</p><p>For this prototype, save the private code given when you submit. It remains valid for seven days. If it expires, contact the intake officer for a replacement after they check your claim.</p></section>
